window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The stars have cursed us all.</b></p> <p>After the devastating events at Zodiac Academy, we have to deal with this hollow reality we're faced with.</p> <p>Lionel seeks to destroy us, the Nymphs seek to destroy the entire Fae race, and between all of it, we have to try and survive each day and prove our worth in this forsaken place.</p> <p>I'm afraid of everything falling apart, but it looks like it already has. Death lurks around every corner, and it wants to claim me and my sister. But together, we will overcome the darkness that seeks to defeat us.</p> <p>Because we were forged in fire. And these flames will never die.</p> <p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!</p> <p>Performed by Jessica Schly, Jon Vertullo, Gregory Linington, Jonathan Sleep, Julian Dailey, Khaya Fraites, and Gabriel Michael as Narrators. Featuring Jessica Schly as Darcy Vega, Khaya Fraites as Tory Vega, Gregory Linington as Lance Orion, Emlyn McFarland as Clara Orion, Ryan Dalusung as Seth Capella, Jon Vertullo as Caleb Altair, Gabriel Michael as Max Rigel, Julian Dailey as Darius Acrux and Jonathan Sleep as Xavier Acrux. With additional performances by Rayner Gabriel, Lydia Kraniotis, Michael Glenn, Kelly Baskin, Karenna Foley, Tyler Hyrchuk, Crystal Lee, Nanette Savard, Darcey Lee, Daniel Llaca, Jeri J. Marshall, Karen Novack, Matthew Bassett, Drew Kopas, Nora Achrati, Lise Bruneau, Laura C. Harris, Yasmin Tuazon, Wyn Delano, Bradley Foster Smith, Christopher Walker, Richard Rohan, Stephanie Németh-Parker, Ken Jackson, Kit Swann, Robb Moreira, Julian Dailey, Eric Messner and Charles Joseph.</p>"; 
